# Local CI gates before push

GitHub CI fails on format and clippy even when `cargo check` passes.

Before every push to `main`:

1. `cargo fmt --all`
2. `cargo fmt --all -- --check`
3. `cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -- -D warnings`
4. Prefer `cargo test --workspace` when behaviour changed

Or run `./scripts/ci-local.sh`.

Do not rely on `cargo check -p app` alone.
